s 6 grids in Niagara County came in under 90% of normal in June to July for 35 of 75 years since 1951, more than any other pair. In 2025 the middle ran 54% of normal in July to August and 43% in August to September. So far in 2026 it has run 203% of normal in March to April and 177% in April to May. Every grid had its driest year in 1963, with grid 28105 at 72% of normal.</p>"}
